{"about":["As the lethal hunter Hornet, adventure through a kingdom ruled by silk and song! Captured and taken to this unfamiliar world, prepare to battle mighty foes and solve ancient mysteries as you ascend on a deadly pilgrimage to the kingdom’s peak.","Hollow Knight: Silksong is the epic sequel to Hollow Knight, the award winning action-adventure. Journey to all-new lands, discover new powers, battle vast hordes of bugs and beasts and uncover secrets tied to your nature and your past.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.","See Health Warnings for important health information before using this product."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/2505/4c666cab506dfdf3e9469c4835f51ee3e472ab350b03b4a3.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/2505/4c666cab506dfdf3e9469c4835f51ee3e472ab350b03b4a3.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/2505/df324b3ee1c4f136f5749164e21ba6656c18d5a6e1790e75.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/2505/df324b3ee1c4f136f5749164e21ba6656c18d5a6e1790e75.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/2505/155e14df406bbfea7ea5ffea758936061396bf91803da6a2.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/2505/155e14df406bbfea7ea5ffea758936061396bf91803da6a2.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/2505/52f93db9eed66234db64703fc27